(PARTITION p0 VALUES LESS THAN (3) ENGINE = DUCKDB,
 PARTITION p1 VALUES LESS THAN (6) ENGINE = DUCKDB,
 PARTITION p2 VALUES LESS THAN (10) ENGINE = DUCKDB) */
